  "description": "Our classic Commuter +, the Bürgermeister*in, is the perfect choice to channel the spirit of this collaboration with Civilist. Made for Berlin with a bulletproof steel frame, invincible SRAM Apex groupset, fat tyres and dynamo lights. Of course we had to finish it off with a one-off sticker bomb colourway, just like your favourite old board.\n\nRide it to work, ride in the forest, ride it in a half pipe, whatever. Have fun.\n\n1 of 2 bikes only and not available for shipping, pickup in Berlin only. Available for collection after 17th August.\nYou can find the other at Civilist in Berlin.",
